Title:             Optimisation for UMSDOS and MSDOS file system
Version:           0.5
Entered-date:      29OCT94
Description:       Patch against kernel 1.1.57 to speed the msdos/umsdos
                   file system by no small factor (from 2 to 4).
                   This is the first release of this optimisation patch.
Keywords           UMSDOS MSDOS file system Optimisation 0.5 FAT driver
Author:            jacques@solucorp.qc.ca (Jacques Gelinas)
Maintained-by:     jacques@solucorp.qc.ca (Jacques Gelinas)
Primary-site:      sunsite.unc.edu:/pub/Linux/ALPHA/umsdos
                   6302  umsdos-0.5.diff.README
                   27685 umsdos-0.5-diff
                   774   umsdos-0.5.diff.lsm
